2026-05-09 17:29:52,691 - INFO - **The case for paying:**
2026-05-09 17:29:52,691 - INFO - - Funding through fares or taxes creates direct accountability and sustainability
2026-05-09 17:29:52,691 - INFO - - Charges can manage demand and reduce overcrowding
2026-05-09 17:29:52,691 - INFO - - Users pay proportionally to what they use
2026-05-09 17:29:52,691 - INFO - - Prevents budget crises that force service cuts
