2026-05-09 17:29:52,692 - INFO - - Can reduce car trips, lowering emissions and congestion
2026-05-09 17:29:52,692 - INFO - - Administrative costs of fare collection disappear
2026-05-09 17:29:52,692 - INFO - - May boost economic activity by freeing up spending money
2026-05-09 17:29:52,692 - INFO - 
