2026-05-09 17:29:52,693 - INFO - Cities like Luxembourg made transit free; others like Singapore charge market rates; most blend approaches.
2026-05-09 17:29:52,693 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:29:52,693 - INFO - Your disagreement isn't resolvable by determining who's "right" because you're likely differing on underlying values (equity vs. sustainability vs. efficiency) rather than facts. A more productive conversation would explore *what outcome each of you actually wants*—fewer cars? Better access for poor people? Efficient use of resources?—and then evaluate which funding model serves that goal.
