2026-05-09 17:31:53,564 - INFO - - Parental stability and consistency
2026-05-09 17:31:53,564 - INFO - - Emotional availability
2026-05-09 17:31:53,564 - INFO - - Quality of the parent-child relationship(s)
2026-05-09 17:31:53,564 - INFO - - Absence of high conflict
2026-05-09 17:31:53,564 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:31:53,564 - INFO - A single parent who provides these can absolutely raise thriving children. A two-parent household with instability, conflict, or neglect produces worse outcomes than a stable single-parent home.
