2026-05-09 17:34:27,343 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:34:27,344 - INFO - So your friend is right about the romantic mythology, but you could both be right if you're really talking about whether transformative, deeply compatible partnerships exist—they do. They're just not magical destiny; they're the result of finding someone reasonably compatible and choosing to build something real with them.
