2026-05-09 17:35:04,001 - INFO - - We have zero confirmed evidence of extraterrestrial life anywhere
2026-05-09 17:35:04,002 - INFO - - The universe is vast, which makes life elsewhere *statistically plausible* as a reasoning exercise
2026-05-09 17:35:04,002 - INFO - - But plausibility isn't evidence
2026-05-09 17:35:04,002 - INFO - 
