2026-05-09 17:36:05,409 - INFO - **Why your friend isn't right that it's simply "a scam":**
2026-05-09 17:36:05,409 - INFO - - Bitcoin isn't a fraudulent scheme designed by operators to steal money. It functions as described technically.
2026-05-09 17:36:05,410 - INFO - - Real economic activity happens on it; people do transact and store value.
2026-05-09 17:36:05,410 - INFO - - It has survived for 15+ years and maintained significant market value.
