2026-05-09 17:36:05,410 - INFO - - Adoption as currency remains limited. Most holders treat it as speculation, not medium of exchange.
2026-05-09 17:36:05,410 - INFO - - There's no consensus that decentralized digital currency needs to exist, or that Bitcoin solves a pressing problem better than alternatives.
2026-05-09 17:36:05,410 - INFO - - Regulatory hostility in major economies is real and ongoing.
