2026-05-09 17:48:55,064 - INFO - Response for Here's something someone wrote online: I'd say this statement makes two separate claims worth distinguishing:
2026-05-09 17:48:55,065 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:48:55,065 - INFO - **On the first part** (difficulty assessing higher powers): I agree this is genuinely hard to settle. The existence of transcendent reality isn't empirically testable in ways that resolve the question.
2026-05-09 17:48:55,065 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:48:55,065 - INFO - **On the second part** (major religions are human inventions): I think this overstates the case, though I understand the appeal of the position.
