2026-05-09 17:48:55,066 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 17:48:55,066 - INFO - - Even if you're skeptical of supernatural claims, the historical evidence shows these religions emerged through complex processes: genuine spiritual experience (however you interpret it), community needs, cultural borrowing, political interests, and charismatic leaders all mixed together. Calling this simply "invention" flattens that complexity.
