2026-05-09 17:50:21,407 - INFO - - Overdiagnosis and overmedication do occur in some contexts (particularly ADHD and depression in certain populations)
2026-05-09 17:50:21,407 - INFO - - Social/economic factors genuinely matter for mental health outcomes
2026-05-09 17:50:21,407 - INFO - - Pharmaceuticals are sometimes prescribed when other interventions would help more
